00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,200
5 words to never say in AI copywriting.

2
00:00:04,380 --> 00:00:12,440
[PAIRS - rapid fire]
Don't say utilize, instead say use - because people short words win.

3
00:00:12,620 --> 00:00:17,490
Don't say in today's world, instead say right now - timeless.

4
00:00:17,670 --> 00:00:23,690
Don't say revolutionize, instead say change - nobody believes revolution.

5
00:00:23,870 --> 00:00:29,100
Don't say leverage, instead say apply - leveraged is AI-slop.

6
00:00:29,280 --> 00:00:34,490
Don't say empower, instead say help - empower is corporate noise.

7
00:00:34,670 --> 00:00:39,710
Your AI copywriting does not have to sound like everyone else's.

8
00:00:39,890 --> 00:00:43,590
Comment 'SYS' and I will send you the full list.

9
